</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02 · 进入新状态或新形态容器：转化变成、说服强迫与细分为 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>STATES ARE CONTAINERS: Transformation & Persuasion — EPE Ch.2 §4.3</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>5 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.2 §4.3)：</b>正如 EPE 对“青蛙变成王子（<i>change into a prince</i>）”和炼金术的分析，英语将<b>「新的外观形态、物质属性或心理决定视为一个容器空间」</b>。因此，变成新形态或分裂成几部分（<i>turn/change/grow/convert/divide/split into</i>），以及把某人说服、哄骗或强迫推入某个行动决定中（<i>talk/coax/trick/force/lure sb into doing x</i>）均使用 INTO。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>into being</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be born or come into existence</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>be</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>All these flowers come to life when the rains come.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>talk <span class='pt-highlight'>into</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [persuade] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>persuade somebody to do something</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>persuade</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We need to <b>talk</b> <b>into</b> this with great care.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>into</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [acquire] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>obtain, especially accidentally</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>acquire</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We need to <b>come</b> <b>into</b> this with great care.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>buy <span class='pt-highlight'>into</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [invest] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>buy stocks or shares of a company</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>invest, commit</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We need to <b>buy</b> <b>into</b> this with great care.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>tear <span class='pt-highlight'>into</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: hit)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>hit violently, as in an attack</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>hit</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>We need to <b>tear</b> <b>into</b> this with great care.</div></div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
